City names from GeoNames, https://www.geonames.org/, via https://github.com/datasets/world-cities at 73c9f54ab9f305168c76d0802db151e30a157b28; Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. Changes: sampling cities and creating fictional club display names with local prefixes/suffixes. No endorsement by GeoNames or the source projects. Country labels used only to join against the existing game country model.
